    {
      "_id": "oo47folzkuj1H6h3",
      "name": "Biotic Charge (NPC)",
      "type": "action",
      "img": "icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-blue-purple.webp",
      "effects": [],
      "flags": {},
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "system": {
        "slug": "me-npc-biotic-charge",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>You surround yourself with a biotic field and launch forward in a devastating dash, crashing into enemies with tremendous impact force. You move up to <strong>60 feet</strong> in a straight line towards an enemy you can see, so long as that enemy does not have total cover, phasing through any obstacles in your path. That target must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:resolve(13+@actor.system.details.level.value+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/3))|options:me-power:me-npc-biotic-charge] save against the creature's power DC.</p><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> Unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes @Damage[(1*(1+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/4)))d6[bludgeoning]] damage.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes @Damage[(3*(1+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/4)))d6[bludgeoning]] damage and is knocked <strong>prone</strong>. Your Biotic Barrier recharges half of its maximum barrier HP.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but @Damage[(6*(1+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/4)))d6[bludgeoning]] damage and pushed <strong>5 feet</strong> away from you. Your Biotic Barrier recharges to full.</p><p><strong>Recharge</strong> The creature can't use this power again for [[/br 1d4 #Recharge]]{1d4 rounds}.</p><hr/><p><em>NPC version. Its DC is 13 + level + a third of level (the moderate DC for the creature's level), and its damage dice multiply every 4 levels. When a creature rolls the save, the result is applied automatically (see the Auto-Apply Power Effects setting).</em></p>",
          "gm": ""
        },
        "rules": [],
        "traits": {
          "otherTags": [],
          "value": [
            "biotic",
            "manipulate",
            "move"
          ],
          "rarity": "common"
        },
