    {
      "_id": "EgjA8rmn2K9guIHg",
      "name": "Nova (NPC)",
      "type": "action",
      "img": "icons/magic/fire/explosion-fireball-medium-purple.webp",
      "effects": [],
      "flags": {},
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "system": {
        "slug": "me-npc-biotic-nova",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>You discharge all of your biotic barrier energy in a devastating point-blank explosion, obliterating everything around you at the cost of your defenses.</p><p><strong>Requirements</strong> You have an active Biotic Barrier with at least 1 HP remaining.</p><p>You expend your entire Biotic Barrier in a @Template[emanation|distance:10]{10-foot emanation}. The damage equals the barrier's current HP at the time of detonation. All creatures in the area must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:resolve(13+@actor.system.details.level.value+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/3))|basic|options:me-power:me-npc-biotic-nova] save against the creature's power DC.</p><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> Unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> Half damage.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> Full damage and pushed <strong>5 feet</strong> away from you.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> Double damage, pushed <strong>10 feet</strong> away, and knocked <strong>prone</strong>.</p><p>Your Biotic Barrier is immediately depleted after using this power. Using Nova records the barrier's HP as this detonation's <strong>force</strong> damage and empties the barrier.</p><p><strong>Recharge</strong> The creature can't use this power again for [[/br 1d4 #Recharge]]{1d4 rounds}.</p><hr/><p><em>NPC version. Its DC is 13 + level + a third of level (the moderate DC for the creature's level), and its damage dice multiply every 4 levels. When a creature rolls the save, the result is applied automatically (see the Auto-Apply Power Effects setting).</em></p>",
          "gm": ""
        },
